Type=Application
Name=Google Photos Auto Compressor
GenericName=Photo and video compressor
Comment=Free up Google Photos storage by replacing big videos and photos with smaller copies
Exec=google-photos-auto-compressor
Icon=google-photos-auto-compressor
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;Graphics;
